installation.markdown:
Requires OpenCode 2.1.4+. This is a CLI-only V2 plugin, not a server plugin or MCP server. Merge this entry into the existing global ~/.config/opencode/cli.json plugins array; do not replace other entries.

```json
{
  "plugins": [
    {"package": "opencode-tab-wrangler@1.0.1", "options": {}}
  ]
}
```

Do not use the legacy singular plugin key or server/project opencode.json. OpenCode reloads CLI config changes automatically. Full native acceptance is tested on 2.1.4, with forward checks on 2.2.2, Linux x64.
